teach.description:
{frame_image}

Type the reading this picture shows, every drum from left to right, for example `{example}`. Read the drums, not the outlines: a drum between two digits counts as the lower one. Each drum showing a whole digit is learnt.

Digits learnt: {known}. Still to learn: {unknown}. Teach again later, when the meter shows other digits, to learn them sooner; the meter also learns them on its own as it turns.

